PARSFILE
#FullDataName Tire (External)`205/55 R16 (FTire)`
FZ_REF 30000
Y_LENGTH 205
#CheckBox2 0    
#CheckBox3 1    
#CheckBox4 1    

#RingCtrl0 10
OPT_TIRE_MODEL 9

X_LENGTH 316
Z_LENGTH 316
PARSFILE Animator\STL_Groups\ShpGrp_d5b55623-3c6f-43ea-b7a0-880a3303d1d2.par
#BlueLink0 Animator: Shape Assembly`195/45 R16` Tires` , Animator`ShpGrp_d5b55623-3c6f-43ea-b7a0-880a3303d1d2

WRITE_WHEEL_OFFSET
*SET_THICKNESS 205
*SET_RADIUS 316
KY_TIRE 1000
OPT_TIRE_INERTIA_EXTERNAL 1
IT 1.2
M_TIRE 19

#External API information
EXTERNAL_TIRE_MODULE_DLL FTireWrapper.dll
INSTALL_EXTERNAL_TIRE_API

#COSIN Tire Interface (FTire) setting data
FTIRE_DATA Extensions\FTire\passenger_car.tir
FTIRE_INIT

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example uses the COSIN / FTire model.
#
#CarSim does not support FTire to run on real-time or faster.
#
#CarSim is only tested with the latest version of the COSIN / FTire model at the release.
#
#FTire solftware as well as its tire program file (CTI.DLL) should be installed separately. CarSim automatically detects the FTire solver installation and loads the tire program solver. A separate license from COSIN for FTire is required to run.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

